{"site":"douban","sid":"1292224","imdb_id":"tt0073486","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0073486/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292224/","chinese_title":"飞越疯人院","foreign_title":"One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest","year":"1975","aka":["飞越喜鹊巢","飞越杜鹃窝(台)"],"region":["美国"],"genre":["剧情"],"language":["英语"],"playdate":["1975-11-19(美国)"],"episodes":"","duration":"133分钟","description":"麦克墨菲（杰克·尼科尔森 Jack Nicholson 饰）为了逃避监狱里的强制劳动，装作精神异常，被送进了精神病院，他的到来，给死气沉沉的精神病院带来了剧烈的冲击。 麦克要求看棒球比赛的电视转播，挑战了医院严格的管理制度，受到护士长拉契特（路易丝·弗莱彻 Louise Fletcher 饰）的百般阻挠；麦克带领病人出海捕鱼，振奋了他们的精神，却让院方头痛不已。院方为了惩处麦克胆大妄为、屡犯院规，决定将他永远留在疯人院。生性自由的麦克再也无法忍受疯人院的生活，他联合病友，高大的印第安人“酋长”，开始自己的计划：飞越疯人院。 本片获1975年第48届奥斯卡最佳影片，最佳男、女主角，最佳导演和最佳改编剧本五项大奖。主人公“不自由，毋宁死”的精神在当今社会仍有很大的现实意义。","poster":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p792238287.jpg","douban_votes":"612492","douban_rating":"9.1","imdb_rating_average":"8.6","imdb_votes":"1167131","imdb_rating":"8.6 / 10 from 1,167,131 users","director":[{"name":"米洛斯·福尔曼 Miloš Forman","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27259329/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p37577.webp"},{"name":"厄比·史密斯 Irby Smith","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27526164/","role":"","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1538495998.93.webp"},{"name":"William Saint John William Saint John","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27524739/","role":"","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"}],"writer":[{"name":"劳伦斯·奥邦 Lawrence Hauben","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27239004/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1523869451.35.webp"},{"name":"博·古德曼 Bo Goldman","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27256219/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p25012.webp"},{"name":"肯·凯西 Ken Kesey","link":"https://www.douban.com/pers